#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:10
msgid "Bounded protocol and user-interface sessions"
msgstr "有界协议与用户界面会话"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:12
msgid ""
"These optional C11 mechanisms consume explicit bytes, existing byte/CAN "
"faces or selected display/input callbacks. The application supplies storage,"
" a serialized executor, protocol policy and finite deadlines. They create no"
" UART/socket owner, worker, device scan or automatic command replay."
msgstr ""
"这些可选 C11 机制消费显式字节、已有 byte／CAN 接口或选定的显示／输入回调。应用提供存储、串行执行者、协议策略和有限 "
"deadline；它们不取得新的 UART／socket 所有权，不创建工作线程、设备扫描或自动命令重放。"

