msgid "[in] Same-domain finite monotonic snapshot."
msgstr "[in] 同域有限单调快照。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for active transfer, or latched failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS、active transfer 时 BUSY，或锁存的失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "Take one queued control byte for copying into transport."
msgstr "取出一个已入队 control byte，供复制到 transport。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "[out] Distinct output byte, unchanged if no control."
msgstr "[out] 独立字节输出，无 control 时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, EMPTY or INVALID; caller retains copied byte until transport "
"accepts it. This call has no transport effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY 或 INVALID；调用者保留复制字节直到 transport 接纳。本调用无 transport 效果。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "Cancel local transfer after joining all calls/callbacks."
msgstr "所有调用／callback 已 join 后取消本地传输。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "Product may send CAN bytes explicitly, then settle transport."
msgstr "产品可显式发送 CAN 取消控制字符，随后结清 transport。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized state."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的串行状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "CANCELLED, or INVALID; does not undo accepted blocks."
msgstr "CANCELLED 或 INVALID；不撤销已接纳 block。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:179
msgid "Caller-owned CRC-128 receiver, no UART, files or firmware policy."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 CRC-128 receiver，无 UART、文件或固件策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:183
msgid "at_client.h"
msgstr "at_client.h"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Bounded single-owner AT command, URC and binary parsing."
msgstr "有界单 owner AT command、URC 和 binary 解析。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Callback view, valid only until callback return."
msgstr "callback view，仅在 callback 返回前有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Bind one caller-owned AT parser to an existing byte stream."
msgstr "将调用者 AT parser 绑定到既有 byte stream。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"Task-only serialized calls; no I/O/heap. Prefix strings are immutable, "
"nonempty and retained until all users join."
msgstr "仅 task 上下文串行调用；无 I/O／heap。prefix string 不可变、非空，保留到所有使用者 join。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[out] Unused/quiescent metadata, private after success."
msgstr "[out] 未使用／没有在途调用的 metadata，成功后为私有状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Disjoint caller buffers and stable callbacks/prefixes."
msgstr "[in] 独立调用者 buffer 与稳定 callback／prefix。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID, unchanged on admission failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；准入失败保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Select optional non-line tokens on an initialized quiescent parser."
msgstr "在已初始化且静默的 parser 上选择可选的非换行 token。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"No I/O, allocation or command replay. Caller joins previous callbacks before"
" changing/releasing a descriptor. HEADER/PROMPT views expire on callback "
"return; the existing expect_binary callback exception applies."
msgstr ""
"不执行 I/O、分配或命令重放。改变／释放 descriptor 前，调用者须会合此前回调。HEADER／PROMPT 视图在回调返回时失效；既有 "
"expect_binary 回调例外仍适用。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[inout] Same serialized task owner, no pending command/data."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行 task 所有者，无待处理 command／data。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Disjoint immutable tokens, or NULL to restore line mode."
msgstr "[in] 不重叠的不可变 token；NULL 表示恢复按行模式。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY for an active/partial parser, or STATE after "
"desynchronization; rejection keeps the original selection."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID；parser 活跃或保留部分输入时为 BUSY，失步后为 STATE；拒绝保持原选择。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Copy one command and append CRLF without starting transport."
msgstr "复制一条命令并追加 CRLF，不启动 transport。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"Only one command is active. Standard OK/ERROR/+CME ERROR/ +CMS ERROR "
"terminate it. Module-specific replies use events."
msgstr ""
"同一时刻只允许一条 active command。标准 OK／ERROR／+CME ERROR／+CMS ERROR 结束命令。模块特定 reply 经"
" event 交付。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[inout] Initialized serialized healthy state."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、串行且 healthy 的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Nonempty text, no NUL/CR/LF, copied before return."
msgstr "[in] 非空文本，不含 NUL／CR／LF，返回前复制。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Text byte count, excludes terminator."
msgstr "[in] 文本字节数，不含终止符。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in the stream clock domain."
msgstr "[in] stream clock 域内的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY, EXHAUSTED, TIMEOUT or STATE."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、EXHAUSTED、TIMEOUT 或 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Advance immediate copying stream calls with explicit budget."
msgstr "以显式预算推进即时复制的 stream 调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"No waits/worker. Callbacks are bounded, cannot reenter any client operation "
"except expect_binary. Timeout/overflow or I/O loss latches "
"desynchronization; recover explicitly after the product has drained/reset "
"the module to a known boundary."
msgstr ""
"无等待／worker。callback 必须有界，除 expect_binary 外不得重入任何 client 操作。timeout／overflow "
"或 I/O 丢失锁存失同步；产品将模块排空／reset 到已知边界后再显式 recover。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[inout] Initialized state and all retained storage still live."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化状态及全部保留存储仍存活。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Finite service deadline, bounded with command time."
msgstr "[in] 有限 service deadline，与 command 时间共同约束。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Nonzero maximum individual read/write calls."
msgstr "[in] 独立 read／write 调用次数的非零上限。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "SUCCESS for progress, BUSY for no progress, or failure."
msgstr "推进时 SUCCESS，无进展时 BUSY，或失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Select the next exact bytes as binary, including CR/LF/NUL."
msgstr "将后续精确字节选择为 binary，包含 CR／LF／NUL。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"Payload is reported in callback-scoped chunks; the caller validates its "
"module's length before invoking this method."
msgstr "payload 以 callback 存活期内的 chunk 报告；调用者在调用本方法前验证模块给出的长度。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[inout] Serialized initialized parser, optionally in event."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化串行 parser，也可在 event 内。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "[in] Positive exact module-announced binary length."
msgstr "[in] 模块宣布的精确正数 binary 长度。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY or STATE; no transport access."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY 或 STATE；不访问 transport。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Reset software framing after external synchronization."
msgstr "外部同步后 reset 软件分帧状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Abandons a timed-out command, never silently replays it."
msgstr "放弃已超时 command，从不静默 replay。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"[inout] All event/stream calls have returned; healthy module boundary and "
"transport drain are independently established."
msgstr "[inout] 所有 event／stream 调用已返回；healthy 模块边界与 transport 排空已独立建立。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY or INVALID; does not reset or probe hardware."
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY 或 INVALID；不 reset 或 probe 硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Optional immutable framing tokens, selected only at a quiet boundary."
msgstr "只在静默边界选择的可选不可变分帧 token。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid ""
"binary_prefix is NULL to disable header recognition; otherwise it is "
"nonempty, printable and shorter than line capacity. A matching line prefix "
"followed by binary_delimiter emits HEADER without the delimiter. The "
"callback validates the full header and calls expect_binary before returning;"
" otherwise framing fails before any payload is interpreted. prompt is zero "
"to disable or one printable byte recognized at empty line position without "
"CRLF. No module command or length grammar lives in the generic parser. "
"Descriptor and strings remain immutable/live through every parser use, "
"including recovery."
msgstr ""
"binary_prefix 为 NULL 时禁用 header 识别；否则须非空、可打印且短于 line 容量。匹配的 line prefix 后出现 "
"binary_delimiter 时，发出不含 delimiter 的 HEADER。回调验证完整 header，并在返回前调用 "
"expect_binary；否则在解释任何 payload 前分帧即失败。prompt 为零表示禁用，否则是在空行位置无须 CRLF "
"即可识别的单个可打印字节。通用 parser 不包含模块命令或长度语法。descriptor 及字符串在所有 parser "
"使用期间保持不可变且存活，包括恢复期间。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Explicit caller-owned state; fields private after initialization."
msgstr "显式调用者状态；初始化后字段为私有。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:185
msgid "Stable assembly ports; no worker, ISR callbacks or UART ownership."
msgstr "稳定装配端口；无 worker、ISR callback 或 UART owner 责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:189
msgid "uart_stream.h"
msgstr "uart_stream.h"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "Copying byte face over one existing UART request owner."
msgstr "在一个既有 UART 请求所有者上提供复制字节接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Author  Nexus Team"
msgstr "作者 Nexus Team"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "Bind a copied stream to an already active exclusive byte-profile UART."
msgstr "把复制字节流连接到已活动且独占的 UART byte profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid ""
"One task owns stream, UART submit/service/RX and teardown. Context, buffer, "
"face, clock and provider outlive SETTLED and all upper users. A clock-domain"
" change requires joined stop and explicit rebind; numeric rollback checks "
"cannot detect a reset to an equal/larger clock value."
msgstr ""
"一个 task 拥有 stream、UART submit／service／RX 和退出。context、buffer、接口、clock 和 "
"provider 保持存活，直到 SETTLED 且全部上层使用者退出。时钟域改变需要已会合的 stop "
"和显式重新绑定；数值回退检查不能识别重置到相同或更大数值的时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[inout] Zeroed fresh or successfully stopped caller metadata."
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的新 metadata，或已经成功停止的调用者 metadata。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[in] Stable face with submit/cancel/service/read_bytes methods."
msgstr "[in] 具有 submit/cancel/service/read_bytes 方法的稳定接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[in] Live same monotonic domain as the UART/Core deadlines."
msgstr "[in] 与 UART／Core deadline 相同的活动单调时间域。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[inout] Disjoint stable private TX copy buffer."
msgstr "[inout] 不重叠且稳定的私有 TX 复制缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[in] Positive exact buffer bytes; provider checks reachability."
msgstr "[in] 明确的正数缓冲字节数；provider 检查可达性。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID, UNSUPPORTED or STATE without UART I/O/rebinding a live "
"adapter. No allocation, lock, queue or controller acquisition."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、INVALID、UNSUPPORTED 或 STATE；没有 UART I/O，不重绑活动适配器。没有分配、锁、队列或控制器取得。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "Query the already bound readonly immediate-copy byte face."
msgstr "查询已绑定的只读立即复制字节接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid ""
"Writes copy at most capacity and accept one inner UART request. Local "
"admission is not wire/peer completion. New writes remain BUSY until acquire-"
"observed SETTLED; later error closes stream admission. Reads use the "
"existing UART RX consumer. EMPTY/zero bytes mean BUSY, never EOF. RX "
"loss/error invalidates that call's copied prefix and latches failure; "
"product restores module framing after physical recovery."
msgstr ""
"write 至多复制 capacity，并接纳一个内部 UART 请求。本地准入不表示线上／对端完成。新 write 保持 BUSY，直到 "
"acquire 观察到 SETTLED；之后的错误关闭 stream 准入。read 使用既有 UART RX 消费者。EMPTY／零字节表示 "
"BUSY，始终不表示 EOF。RX 丢失／错误使该次已复制前缀失效并锁存故障；产品在物理恢复后重建模块分帧。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[in] Initialized stable metadata."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且稳定的 metadata。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "Existing face or NULL for invalid/uninitialized metadata; no I/O."
msgstr "既有接口；metadata 无效或未初始化时为 NULL；不执行 I/O。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "Progress UART once and consume the real inner settlement predicate."
msgstr "推进 UART 一次，并消费内部请求的真实结清条件。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid ""
"Caller explicitly invokes this alongside AT/module progress. IRQ wake is a "
"hint, not completion. No hidden execution or renewed deadline."
msgstr "调用者在推进 AT／模块时显式调用本方法。IRQ 唤醒是提示，不代表完成。没有隐藏执行或 deadline 续期。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[inout] Same initialized serialized owner and live storage."
msgstr "[inout] 同一已初始化的串行所有者及存活存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid ""
"SUCCESS when locally idle/settled, BUSY while borrowed, or latched "
"transfer/clock/loss failure. Failure never revokes a borrow."
msgstr "本地空闲／已结清时为 SUCCESS，仍借用时为 BUSY，或返回已锁存的传输／时钟／丢失故障。失败始终不撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "Close byte admission and cancel/drain the exact original TX request."
msgstr "关闭字节准入，并取消／排空原始的精确 TX 请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid ""
"No timeout revokes a borrow. Stop still drains after a clock/data fault; "
"cancellation cannot extend the accepted deadline. Success reports local "
"withdrawal, not prior delivery, controller stop, RX/IRQ join or module "
"synchronization. Product separately stops those external owners before "
"reclaiming them. A quarantined request remains live through recovery."
msgstr ""
"超时始终不撤销借用。发生时钟／数据故障后 stop 仍继续排空；取消不能延长已接受的 "
"deadline。成功表示本地撤回，不表示此前交付、控制器停止、RX／IRQ "
"会合或模块同步。产品先独立停止这些外部所有者，再回收它们。隔离请求在恢复期间继续保持存活。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "[inout] Same metadata after all upper stream callers join."
msgstr "[inout] 全部上层 stream 调用者会合后的同一 metadata。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after acquire-observed SETTLED/no borrow; BUSY/error retains "
"request/buffer/provider and requires further cleanup."
msgstr ""
"只有 acquire 观察到 SETTLED／无借用后才返回 SUCCESS；BUSY／错误保留 "
"request／buffer／provider，并要求继续清理。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:191
msgid "Caller-owned inner request and copy storage identity; fields private."
msgstr "调用者拥有的内部请求和复制存储身份；字段为私有。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:195
msgid "canopen.h"
msgstr "canopen.h"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Selected CANopenNode server profile over an existing CAN owner."
msgstr "既有 CAN 所有者上的选定 CANopenNode server profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Protocol states, independent of electrical output or motor state."
msgstr "协议状态，独立于电气输出或电机状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "A peer is unknown until an actual heartbeat has been observed."
msgstr "实际观察到心跳前，对端保持未知。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "NMT reset requests are observations; no reset is executed."
msgstr "NMT reset 请求仅是观察事实，不执行 reset。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Query exact workspace bytes for the selected fixed node profile."
msgstr "查询选定固定 node profile 的精确工作区字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid ""
"No heap or source preparation. Static consumers provide an explicitly "
"budgeted aligned arena and verify this query during initialization."
msgstr "没有堆或源码准备。静态消费者提供具有明确预算和对齐的 arena，并在初始化时核验本查询结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[in] Positive number of product VAR objects."
msgstr "[in] 正数个产品 VAR 对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Required bytes, or zero for impossible count/arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "所需字节数；计数不可实现或算术溢出时为零。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Alignment of private selected protocol state, with no allocation."
msgstr "私有选定协议状态的对齐要求，不执行分配。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Initialize one selected NMT/HB/expedited-SDO/asynchronous-PDO node."
msgstr "初始化一个选定的 NMT／HB／快速 SDO／异步 PDO 节点。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid ""
"Init reads the explicit clock but does not start/configure hardware. Input "
"spans must be valid and disjoint from node/workspace/tx slots. Object values"
" may alias only by explicit product design. Public APIs expose Nexus types; "
"upstream OD and Handles stay private."
msgstr ""
"init 读取显式时钟，但不启动／配置硬件。输入 span 必须有效，并与 node／workspace／tx slots "
"不重叠。对象值仅可按产品显式设计互为别名。公共 API 暴露 Nexus 类型，上游 OD 和 Handle 保持私有。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[out] Fresh zero identity, distinct from all retained storage."
msgstr "[out] 新的零初始化身份，与全部保留存储分离。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[in] Valid explicit profile; its fields are copied."
msgstr "[in] 有效的显式 profile；复制其字段。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[inout] Zero/unpublished aligned exact-profile arena."
msgstr "[inout] 已清零、未发布、对齐且符合精确 profile 的 arena。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[in] Available arena bytes, at least the reported requirement."
msgstr "[in] 可用 arena 字节数，至少满足查询的需求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED; no CAN transmission on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID／STATE／UNSUPPORTED；拒绝时无 CAN 传输。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Progress bounded receive, real protocol objects and one TX request."
msgstr "推进有界接收、真实协议对象和一个 TX 请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid ""
"Up to receive_budget frames are processed. Queueing preserves its original "
"deadline; later calls never renew it. ACCEPTED CAN request storage remains "
"borrowed through acquire-observed SETTLED. RX loss, time discontinuity, "
"queue exhaustion and bus-off close admission. Reset requests close admission"
" and are reported, never executed. No protocol write authenticates or "
"validates product command policy."
msgstr ""
"至多处理 receive_budget 帧。排队保持其原始 deadline，后续调用始终不续期。已 ACCEPTED 的 CAN "
"请求存储持续被借用，直到 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。RX 丢失、时间不连续、队列耗尽和 bus-off "
"关闭准入。重置请求关闭准入并被报告，始终不执行。协议写入不会认证或验证产品命令策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[inout] Live same-executor identity and retained storage."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者的活动身份及保留存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[in] Finite absolute same-clock budget for newly queued TX."
msgstr "[in] 新排队 TX 使用的有限绝对同域时钟预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[out] Distinct copied observation, written after progress."
msgstr "[out] 推进后写入的独立复制观察。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for reentry, or error requiring explicit stop/recovery."
msgstr "SUCCESS、重入时的 BUSY，或要求显式 stop／recovery 的错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Request the selected asynchronous TPDO from current staging data."
msgstr "请求从当前暂存数据发送选定的异步 TPDO。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Copies wire data during a later step; caller keeps its objects stable."
msgstr "在之后的 step 中复制 wire 数据；调用者保持其对象稳定。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[inout] Live same-executor OPERATIONAL node, not closing."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者中处于 OPERATIONAL 且未关闭的活动 node。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "SUCCESS, STATE or BUSY for reentry; does not call hardware."
msgstr "SUCCESS、STATE 或重入时的 BUSY；不调用硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Close admission, discard unsent copies and drain the accepted TX."
msgstr "关闭准入、丢弃未发送的副本并排空已接受 TX。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid ""
"Cancellation/timeout never revokes a borrow. Retry stop while provider "
"service drains. This does not stop the outer CAN controller, reset a peer, "
"free storage or join external component users. No auto recovery."
msgstr ""
"取消／超时始终不撤销借用。provider service 排空时持续重试 stop。本方法不停止外层 CAN "
"控制器、不重置对端、不释放存储，也不会合外部组件使用者。没有自动恢复。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "[inout] Live same-executor identity and every retained buffer."
msgstr "[inout] 同一执行者的活动身份及每个保留缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "SUCCESS clears node.state; BUSY/IO keeps the original storage alive."
msgstr "SUCCESS 清空 node.state；BUSY／IO 保持原存储存活。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Product staging variable, subindex zero, exactly 1/2/4 wire bytes."
msgstr "产品暂存变量，subindex 为零，恰好 1/2/4 wire bytes。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid ""
"Entries are strictly increasing in 0x2000..0x5fff. Little-endian data is "
"mutable by the same executor only. RPDO requires writable=true. Each "
"selected RPDO/TPDO totals 1..8 bytes, mapped in object order. These are raw "
"staging values, never permission to mutate active gains or execute an "
"actuator command without product validation."
msgstr ""
"条目按 0x2000..0x5fff 严格递增。Little-endian 数据只允许同一执行者修改。RPDO 要求 "
"writable=true。每个选定 RPDO／TPDO 总计 1..8 "
"bytes，按对象顺序映射。这些是原始暂存值，始终不授权绕过产品验证修改活动增益或执行器命令。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Copied outgoing frame and original finite queue deadline."
msgstr "复制的待发帧及原始有限排队 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Explicit node profile, storage and sole existing classic CAN owner."
msgstr "显式 node profile、存储及唯一的既有 classic CAN 所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid ""
"One Thread executor serializes init/step/TPDO/stop and object access. Bind a"
" started CAN port with routes/filters for NMT, selected peer HB, default SDO"
" and default PDO IDs. No second controller owner is created. Stable "
"clock/port/context, objects/value storage, tx slots and workspace remain "
"live until stop succeeds and all component users have joined. No IRQ call, "
"dynamic allocator, worker or global current node exists."
msgstr ""
"一个 Thread 执行者串行执行 init／step／TPDO／stop 和对象访问。连接一个已启动 CAN 端口，其 route／filter 覆盖"
" NMT、选定对端 HB、默认 SDO 和默认 PDO ID。不创建第二个控制器所有者。稳定的 clock／port／context、对象及值存储、tx"
" slots 和工作区保持存活，直到 stop 成功且全部组件使用者已会合。不提供 IRQ 调用、动态分配器、工作线程或全局 current node。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Fresh copied protocol observation, with no retained pointers."
msgstr "新的复制协议观察，不保留指针。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:197
msgid "Caller identity; state points into the supplied private workspace."
msgstr "调用者身份；state 指向所提供的私有工作区。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:201
msgid "cia402.h"
msgstr "cia402.h"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Explicit CiA 402 Profile Velocity objects and axis requests."
msgstr "显式 CiA 402 Profile Velocity 对象与轴请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Selected velocity profile constants, not a wire field."
msgstr "选定速度 profile 的常量，不是线字段。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Selected drive states, independently confirmed by axis facts."
msgstr "由轴事实独立确认的选定驱动状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Initialize a fresh profile without I/O or retained input pointers."
msgstr "初始化全新 profile，不执行 I/O 或保留输入指针。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "No mode is advertised until actual axis feedback confirms mode 3."
msgstr "实际轴反馈确认模式 3 之前，不宣告模式。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[out] Fresh zeroed state, disjoint from config."
msgstr "[out] 与 config 不相交的全新清零状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[in] Explicit finite scaling and positive representable limits."
msgstr "[in] 显式有限比例与可表示的正限制。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or BUSY; rejection leaves state unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 BUSY；拒绝不改变状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Bind the profile's real standard OD to one existing CANopen transport."
msgstr "将 profile 的真实标准 OD 绑定到一个已有 CANopen 传输。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid ""
"RPDO: controlword(2), mode(1), target velocity(4). TPDO: statusword(2), "
"actual mode(1), velocity(4). Each is seven bytes, asynchronously mapped. SDO"
" exposes fixed limits; no SYNC, CSP/CSV, homing or PP is selected."
msgstr ""
"RPDO：controlword(2)、mode(1)、target velocity(4)。TPDO：statusword(2)、actual "
"mode(1)、velocity(4)。各七字节，异步映射。SDO 提供固定限制；不选择 SYNC、CSP/CSV、回零或 PP。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[inout] Initialized stable unbound profile."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、稳定且未绑定的 profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[out] Fresh zero identity, retained through joined stop."
msgstr "[out] 全新清零身份，保留至停止和 join 完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[in] Explicit CANopen settings, objects=NULL/count=0."
msgstr "[in] 显式 CANopen 设置，objects=NULL/count=0。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[inout] Aligned caller arena for OBJECT_COUNT objects."
msgstr "[inout] 调用者为 OBJECT_COUNT 个对象提供的对齐 arena。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[in] Available bytes, checked by the existing CANopen query."
msgstr "[in] 可用字节数，由已有 CANopen 查询校验。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "SUCCESS or exact admission error; no CAN transmission on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或精确准入错误；拒绝时不进行 CAN 发送。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Consume real protocol and actual-axis facts, then copy one request."
msgstr "消费真实协议与实际轴事实，然后复制一个请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid ""
"Invalid feedback, target bounds, live network loss and protocol reset close "
"admission. A rising fault-reset only requests recovery; observed reset "
"permission and removed fault are required before DISABLED. It never enables "
"motion. Caller still owns command freshness and hardware shutdown. A "
"protocol/axis observation is not an electrical guarantee."
msgstr ""
"无效反馈、目标越界、运行中网络丢失和协议复位关闭准入。故障复位上升沿只请求恢复；观察到复位许可且故障已解除，才能进入 "
"DISABLED。它绝不会使能运动。调用者仍负责命令新鲜度与硬件关闭。协议／轴观察不是电气保证。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[inout] Same-executor initialized live profile."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且存活的同执行者 profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[in] Fresh report from the bound node's completed step."
msgstr "[in] 来自绑定节点已完成 step 的新鲜报告。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[in] Fresh validated actual-axis facts, not previous requests."
msgstr "[in] 新鲜、已校验的实际轴事实，不是先前请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[out] Distinct complete copy, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 独立完整副本，绝不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS also reports latched faults; INVALID leaves output unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS 也可报告已锁存故障；INVALID 不改变输出。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Clear profile storage only after the bound protocol has stopped."
msgstr "仅在绑定协议停止后清理 profile 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid ""
"Does no I/O and does not prove that the motor has stopped or deenergized."
msgstr "不执行 I/O，也不证明电机已经停止或断能。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "[inout] Same-executor state; all external users already joined."
msgstr "[inout] 同执行者状态；所有外部使用者已 join。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS or BUSY while node state is still live."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或节点状态仍存活时返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Immutable user-unit scaling and fixed Profile Velocity limits."
msgstr "不可变的用户单位比例与固定 Profile Velocity 限制。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid ""
"Velocity objects use signed units; acceleration objects use the same units "
"per second. The mechanical side and direction are product facts. No CiA 402 "
"universal radian scaling is implied. Limits and ramps are read-only SDO "
"objects in this selected profile, not live parameters."
msgstr ""
"速度对象使用有符号单位；加速度对象使用同一单位每秒。机械侧和方向属于产品事实。不隐含 CiA 402 统一弧度比例。本选定 profile "
"中的限制和斜坡是只读 SDO 对象，不是运行期参数。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Causally current axis facts supplied by the same Thread executor."
msgstr "同一个 Thread 执行者提供、因果关系上当前有效的轴事实。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid ""
"The application proves freshness, units and mechanical-side conversion. "
"ready, voltage_enabled and operation_enabled describe actual observed "
"conditions, never the preceding action request. target_reached requires the "
"application's velocity/quality/dwell criterion. The profile neither controls"
" hardware nor interprets trajectory completion as arrival."
msgstr ""
"应用证明新鲜度、单位及机械侧换算。ready、voltage_enabled 和 operation_enabled "
"描述实际观察条件，绝不是前一个动作请求。target_reached 要求应用的速度／质量／驻留判据。profile "
"不控制硬件，也不将轨迹完成视为到位。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Copied requests for the application's actuator/axis admission layer."
msgstr "复制给应用执行器／轴准入层的请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid ""
"These are requests, not applied states or physical safety guarantees. Same-"
"value repeats are not new-command evidence. The application owns an explicit"
" authorization lease; NMT or these snapshots do not renew it. halt and "
"quick_stop require valid local feedback and energy handling. Deactivation "
"still requires the real owner to withdraw and join."
msgstr ""
"这些是请求，不是已应用状态或物理安全保证。相同值重复不是新命令证据。应用拥有显式授权租约；NMT 或这些快照不为其续期。halt 和 "
"quick_stop 要求有效本地反馈与能量处理。停用仍要求真实 owner 撤回并 join。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "Caller-owned selected profile and stable private-node OD storage."
msgstr "调用者拥有的选定 profile 与稳定的私有节点 OD 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid ""
"One Thread executor serializes every API and CANopen step. Fields are not "
"task/IRQ controls. Keep the object and its bound node alive until CANopen "
"stop succeeds and external users join, then release. There is no allocator, "
"worker, controller owner, automatic motion or reset."
msgstr ""
"一个 Thread 执行者串行调用所有 API 和 CANopen step。字段不是 task/IRQ 控制。对象及其绑定节点须存活至 CANopen"
" stop 成功且外部使用者 join，然后才能释放。不含分配器、worker、控制器 owner、自动运动或自动复位。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:203
msgid "PV owns exactly its selected OD, without position-mode storage."
msgstr "PV 只拥有其选定 OD，不含位置模式存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:207
msgid "cia402_position.h"
msgstr "cia402_position.h"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Selected absolute single-point Profile Position handshake."
msgstr "选定的绝对单点 Profile Position 握手。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Selected position profile constants, not a wire field."
msgstr "选定位置 profile 的常量，不是线字段。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Initialize a fresh selected PP object without I/O."
msgstr "初始化全新选定 PP 对象，不执行 I/O。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "No mechanical reference is discovered or hardware enabled."
msgstr "不发现机械参考，也不使能硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[out] Fresh zero storage disjoint from config."
msgstr "[out] 与 config 不相交的全新清零存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[in] Explicit finite units, bounds, ramp and settling contract."
msgstr "[in] 显式有限单位、边界、斜坡和稳定判据合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Bind fixed PP standard objects to the real asynchronous CANopen node."
msgstr "将固定 PP 标准对象绑定到真实异步 CANopen 节点。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid ""
"RPDO: 6040h(2),6060h(1),607Ah(4). TPDO: 6041h(2),6061h(1),6064h(4). Both "
"total seven bytes. Fixed window/ramp objects remain SDO-readable."
msgstr ""
"RPDO：6040h(2)、6060h(1)、607Ah(4)。TPDO：6041h(2)、6061h(1)、6064h(4)。两者均为七字节。固定窗口／斜坡对象仍可通过"
" SDO 读取。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[out] Fresh zero node, retained through joined stop."
msgstr "[out] 全新清零节点，保留至停止和 join 完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[in] Normal explicit settings with objects=NULL/count=0."
msgstr "[in] 常规显式设置，objects=NULL/count=0。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[inout] Aligned arena for POSITION_OBJECT_COUNT objects."
msgstr "[inout] 为 POSITION_OBJECT_COUNT 个对象提供的对齐 arena。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[in] Available caller bytes."
msgstr "[in] 调用者提供的可用字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Advance the bit-4 handshake and evaluate actual measured settling."
msgstr "推进 bit-4 握手并评价实际测量的稳定状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid ""
"Bit 12 follows genuine matching admission; bit 10 follows measured position "
"AND velocity within fixed windows for the declared dwell. Trajectory "
"completion alone is ignored. An unaccepted request expires after "
"transport.maximum_step_us; a held bit 4 never generates repeats. Faults "
"close requests; reset never automatically resumes an old point."
msgstr ""
"bit 12 跟随真实匹配的准入；bit 10 要求实测位置及速度在固定窗口内持续满足声明的驻留时间。仅轨迹完成会被忽略。未接纳请求在 "
"transport.maximum_step_us 后过期；持续为高的 bit 4 绝不会重复生成请求。故障关闭请求；复位绝不自动恢复旧位置点。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[inout] Stable initialized bound same-executor PP state."
msgstr "[inout] 稳定、已初始化并绑定的同执行者 PP 状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[in] Fresh report from the bound CANopen node."
msgstr "[in] 来自绑定 CANopen 节点的新鲜报告。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[in] Fresh actual sample and matching axis admission fact."
msgstr "[in] 新鲜实际样本及匹配的轴准入事实。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[out] Distinct copied application requests, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 独立复制的应用请求，绝不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "SUCCESS including observed fault, or INVALID without mutation."
msgstr "SUCCESS，包括已观察故障；或 INVALID 且不修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Clear joined profile storage without stopping an actuator."
msgstr "清理已 join 的 profile 存储，不停止执行器。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid ""
"The physical power and mechanism still follow their own owner contracts."
msgstr "物理功率与机构仍遵循各自的 owner 合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "[inout] Same-executor state and joined external users."
msgstr "[inout] 同执行者状态，外部使用者已 join。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID for NULL or BUSY while protocol remains bound/live."
msgstr "SUCCESS、NULL 时的 INVALID，或协议仍绑定／存活时的 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Fixed user-unit position, ramp and measured-settling requirements."
msgstr "固定用户单位的位置、斜坡与实测稳定要求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid ""
"Position and velocity scales are independently declared, on the same "
"mechanical side. Only absolute immediate rest-to-rest points are selected; "
"relative, queued and moving replanning are not advertised. epoch is a "
"nonzero application session identity. Join all users and choose a new epoch "
"before reinitializing; generations never wrap."
msgstr ""
"位置和速度比例独立声明，且属于同一机械侧。只选择绝对、立即、静止到静止的位置点；不宣告相对、排队或运动中重规划。epoch "
"是非零应用会话身份。重新初始化前须 join 全部使用者并选择新 epoch；generation 永不回绕。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Actual position samples and explicit axis admission acknowledgments."
msgstr "实际位置样本与显式轴准入确认。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid ""
"observed_at uses the bound transport's monotonic microsecond domain; "
"sequence is consecutive and nonzero, even at rest. accepted_generation names"
" the action genuinely admitted by the axis; it is a local adapter fact "
"paired with acknowledgement_epoch, not a standard wire field. Samples meet "
"the stated cadence; behavior between them is unmeasured."
msgstr ""
"observed_at 使用绑定传输的单调微秒域；sequence 连续且非零，即使静止时也如此。accepted_generation "
"指明轴真实准入的动作；它与 acknowledgement_epoch 成对，是局部适配器事实，不是标准线字段。样本满足声明的节拍；样本间行为未经测量。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Stable repeated admission request for one explicit position point."
msgstr "同一个显式位置点的稳定重复准入请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid ""
"The adapter deduplicates generation and acknowledges actual admission, not "
"receipt. A repeated action never authorizes another move or lease renewal. "
"Position is copied; only an admitted axis owns execution."
msgstr ""
"适配器按 generation 去重，并确认实际准入而不是接收。重复动作绝不授权另一场运动或续期租约。位置通过复制交付；只有准入后的轴拥有执行责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid "Independent PP state and exact selected OD; PV pays no PP storage."
msgstr "独立 PP 状态及精确选定 OD；PV 不承担 PP 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:209
msgid ""
"Same-executor caller storage, never copied or moved while initialized. Keep "
"alive until bound CANopen stop and every external user join."
msgstr "调用者在同执行者提供存储；初始化期间绝不复制或移动。保留至绑定 CANopen 停止且每个外部使用者 join。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:213
msgid "lvgl.h"
msgstr "lvgl.h"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Selected caller-arena LVGL RGB565 display and input bridge."
msgstr "选定的调用者 arena 上的 LVGL RGB565 显示与输入桥。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Exact profile bytes: private global state and32KiB bounded TLSF pool."
msgstr "精确 profile 字节数：私有全局状态与有界 32KiB TLSF 池。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Required alignment for workspace and RGB565 tile storage."
msgstr "工作区与 RGB565 tile 存储所需对齐。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Bind one explicit selected GUI runtime without touching the display."
msgstr "连接一个显式选定的 GUI runtime，不触碰显示设备。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid ""
"The pinned upstream profile has one global GUI owner. This bridge locates "
"its global state and allocator pool in the caller workspace. Pixels and "
"opaque contexts remain live and disjoint from gui, config and workspace. "
"Config is copied. No peripheral initialization or task occurs. Widget "
"allocations use only the explicit32KiB arena. Supplier assertions/arena "
"exhaustion report through nx_fault_observe and park; product UI budgets and "
"factory checks remain necessary. Ordinary consumers see no supplier type; "
"explicit UI code uses LVGLProfile."
msgstr ""
"锁定上游 profile 具有一个全局 GUI 所有者。本桥将其全局状态和分配器池放在调用者工作区。pixels 和不透明 context "
"保持存活，并与 gui、config 和 workspace 不重叠。复制 config，不初始化外设或 task。widget 只在显式 32KiB "
"arena 中分配。供应商断言／arena 耗尽通过 nx_fault_observe 报告并停驻；产品 UI 预算和 factory "
"检查仍然必要。普通消费者看不到供应商类型；显式 UI 代码使用 LVGLProfile。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[inout] Zero/stopped exclusive object retained through stop."
msgstr "[inout] 清零／已停止的独占对象，保留到 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[in] Call-owned copied settings, separate from all output."
msgstr "[in] 调用期间有效且被复制的配置，与全部输出分离。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[inout] Aligned caller arena retained through stop."
msgstr "[inout] 对齐的调用者 arena，保留到 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[in] At least nx_lvgl_workspace_bytes, never a hidden heap."
msgstr "[in] 至少 nx_lvgl_workspace_bytes，始终不使用隐藏堆。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, EXHAUSTED before effects, or BUSY for a live owner."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID；产生效果前容量不足时为 EXHAUSTED，存在活动所有者时为 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Advance the selected real GUI once from an external elapsed budget."
msgstr "按外部显式经过时间预算推进选定真实 GUI 一次。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid ""
"Explicit elapsed time must belong to one admitted application epoch. "
"Rendering/user events run synchronously; deadline is not a preemptive CPU "
"WCET bound. No sleeping, hidden timer, worker or request retention. A failed"
" settled flush ends its tile access, marks GUI failed and does not claim "
"physical display completion. Join UI users and stop before recovering the "
"separately owned uncertain device. No automatic retry."
msgstr ""
"显式经过时间必须属于一个已准入的应用 epoch。渲染／用户事件同步运行；deadline 不是可抢占的 CPU WCET 上界。没有休眠、隐藏 "
"timer、工作线程或请求保留。已结清的 flush 失败会结束 tile 访问、标记 GUI "
"故障，但不声明物理显示完成。恢复独立拥有且状态不确定的器件前，先会合 UI 使用者并 stop。没有自动重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[inout] Live same-task GUI owner and stable buffers."
msgstr "[inout] 同一 task 的活动 GUI 所有者和稳定缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[in] Explicit elapsed milliseconds, at most1000 per call."
msgstr "[in] 显式经过的毫秒数，每次至多 1000。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[in] Finite absolute port-clock deadline for all callbacks."
msgstr "[in] 所有回调共用的有限绝对端口时钟 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE after a latched port failure, BUSY on reentry, or "
"the first display/input callback failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID；端口故障锁存后为 STATE，重入为 BUSY，或返回首个显示／输入回调故障。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Delete selected GUI objects and release caller arena references."
msgstr "删除选定 GUI 对象并释放调用者 arena 引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid ""
"Uses real lv_deinit; callbacks/context remain valid until it returns. Every "
"external widget pointer becomes invalid. Stops no transport, panel, touch "
"device or Platform; those owners retain their independent recovery "
"responsibility. Reclaim arena/pixels only after SUCCESS."
msgstr ""
"使用真实 lv_deinit；回调／context 保持有效直到它返回。每个外部 widget 指针随后失效。不停止 "
"transport、panel、touch device 或 Platform；这些所有者保留各自独立的恢复责任。只有 SUCCESS 后才可回收 "
"arena／pixels。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "[inout] Sole task after publishers/widget users have joined."
msgstr "[inout] 发布者／widget 使用者已会合后的唯一 task。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid ""
"SUCCESS for completed/absent state, BUSY during callback/render, or "
"INVALID/STATE for an incorrect owner."
msgstr "状态已结束／不存在时为 SUCCESS，callback／render 期间为 BUSY，所有者错误时为 INVALID／STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Complete copied input sample in selected logical pixel coordinates."
msgstr "选定逻辑像素坐标中的完整复制输入样本。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Explicit selected display, input and caller-owned tile storage."
msgstr "显式选定显示、输入及调用者拥有的 tile 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid ""
"One ordinary nonreentrant task advances LVGL, widgets and these ports. flush"
" synchronously consumes the complete packed native RGB565 span; no access "
"survives any return, including failure. input synchronously copies one "
"point, EMPTY preserves the previous point. Both callbacks have a declared "
"finite work bound and receive the current service's unchanged absolute "
"deadline. Contexts remain live until successful stop. Optional input is NULL"
" with NULL context. No OS lock or task is created. Width and height "
"are1..320. Tile capacity is at least one logical row; alignment is reported "
"by nx_lvgl_workspace_alignment."
msgstr ""
"一个普通且不重入的 task 推进 LVGL、widget 和这些端口。flush 同步消费完整且紧密排列的原生 RGB565 "
"span；任何返回之后均不再访问，包括失败返回。input 同步复制一个 point，EMPTY 保留此前 "
"point。两个回调均声明有限工作上界，且接收当前 service 未改变的绝对 deadline。context 保持存活直到 stop 成功。可选 "
"input 为 NULL 时 context 也为 NULL。不创建 OS 锁或 task。width 和 height 为 1..320。tile "
"容量至少为一个逻辑 row；对齐要求由 nx_lvgl_workspace_alignment 给出。"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:215
msgid "Opaque selected state; zero before first initialization."
msgstr "选定状态为不透明类型；首次初始化前清零。"
